# Content no player could ever reach is a load error (Q3). The check is generous: it takes
# every requirement but `done` as one the character can meet, and ignores timing, so what it
# can't reach can never be reached.

# Riverhold's quests can all be reached; the only problem is that quests can't load yet.
validate docs/examples/riverhold

# A rumour and the gossip each wait on the other; the patrol needs a promotion that only
# comes after its step has moved on, closing it; and the siege's assault needs its
# aftermath, which needs the siege over.
validate crates/cli/tests/fixtures/worlds/dead_ends
